This repository is the import closure of the final statements of the G32
formalization, cut from commit 0ea348972dc8396faee9eef1caa89f9d5908823f of the
author's development repository.

This product includes software from the following projects, each under the
Apache License, Version 2.0, with its licence file (and NOTICE file, where the
project has one) kept in the ported tree:

  - lean-CA (Bastiaan J. Braams), in HodgeLean/Ported/LeanCA
  - TauCeti (the Tau Ceti contributors), in HodgeLean/Ported/TauCeti
  - lean4-markman25-hodge-abelian-fourfolds, in HodgeLean/Port/Markman
  - hironaka (Resolution), https://github.com/resolutionorg/hironaka at commit
    044d89c9455859446fc5e986667319f910e15f4b, in HodgeLean/Ported/Hironaka
  - NYLL (N. Yamaguchi), https://github.com/n-yamaguchi-0729/NYLL at commit
    21896ca9a10770a5ae31421357b003e76d06c965, in HodgeLean/Ported/NYLL; its own
    NOTICE file, HodgeLean/Ported/NYLL/NOTICE, lists further third-party notices and
    is kept with it

The Weil port (AxiomMath) present in the development repository is not in the import closure of
the G32 statements and is not included in this snapshot.

It depends on Paul-Lez/HodgeConjecture and on Mathlib, which are fetched
separately at the commits pinned in lake-manifest.json.
